>> title: Tomato Soup
>> category: Soups
>> tags: tomato, basil, blender, lunch
>> counters: Diner
>> aka: cream of tomato, tomato bisque, tomato basil soup
>> servings: 4
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: sweat 6 min
>> step.2: simmer 25 min
>> step.3: purée smooth

Sweat @yellow onion{1%large} and @garlic{4%cloves} in @unsalted butter{3%Tbs} in a #Dutch oven{} for ~{6%min}.

Simmer @&(~1)aromatics{} for ~{25%min} with @canned whole tomatoes{28%oz}(800 g), @chicken stock{2%cups}(480 mL; or vegetable stock), @sugar{1%tsp}, and @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp}.

Purée @&(~1)soup{} until smooth with an #immersion blender{}.

Finish @&(~1)soup{} off the heat with @heavy cream{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @fresh basil{1/4%cup}, and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}.
